Dear Yihui,
thanks for your answer.
It works for changing the font-size locally with text ouside the r-code.
However, the r-code itself remains at the global size.

## begin R-code for toy example ----------------------------------------

# *.md
cat(
'<div class="foo-1">
* bla
```{r this}
sessionInfo()
```
</div>',
file = 'report_knit_.md')

# *.css
cat(
'<style type="text/css">

body, td {
   font-size: 14px;
}
code.r{
  font-size: 10px;
}
pre {
  font-size: 10px
}

div.foo-1 {
  font-size: 8px;
}
</style>', file='first.css')

# *html
library(knitr)
knit("report_knit_.md")

system('pandoc -s -S -i -t slidy --mathjax report.md -o report.html -c first.css ')

system('firefox report.html')

## end R-code --------------------------------------------

Do you have any ideas to change the r-code size?
Regards,
René

